@authServer = http://127.0.0.1:9000
@clientApp = http://127.0.0.1:8081
@clientId = identityforge-client
@clientSecret = change-this-client-secret
@accessToken = replace-with-access-token
@refreshToken = replace-with-refresh-token
@csrfToken = replace-with-csrf-token
@sessionCookie = replace-with-session-cookie

### Client home controller
GET {{clientApp}}/

### Protected client profile (redirects without a client session)
GET {{clientApp}}/profile

### Start the interactive Authorization Code + PKCE flow
GET {{clientApp}}/oauth2/authorization/identityforge

### Authorization-server login controller
GET {{authServer}}/login

### Authorization-server registration controller
GET {{authServer}}/register

### Register a user
# First load /register and copy the CSRF token and session cookie.
POST {{authServer}}/register
Cookie: JSESSIONID={{sessionCookie}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

username=alice&email=alice%40example.com&password=a-secure-password&_csrf={{csrfToken}}

### OIDC discovery
GET {{authServer}}/.well-known/openid-configuration

### Authorization server metadata
GET {{authServer}}/.well-known/oauth-authorization-server

### Public signing keys
GET {{authServer}}/oauth2/jwks

### UserInfo protected API
GET {{authServer}}/userinfo
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Rotate a refresh token
POST {{authServer}}/oauth2/token
Authorization: Basic {{clientId}} {{clientSecret}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=refresh_token&refresh_token={{refreshToken}}

### Revoke a refresh token
POST {{authServer}}/oauth2/revoke
Authorization: Basic {{clientId}} {{clientSecret}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

token={{refreshToken}}&token_type_hint=refresh_token

### Invalid redirect URI must be rejected
GET {{authServer}}/oauth2/authorize?response_type=code&client_id={{clientId}}&scope=openid%20profile&redirect_uri=http://attacker.example/callback&state=invalid-redirect-test&code_challenge=aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa&code_challenge_method=S256

### Missing PKCE challenge must be rejected
GET {{authServer}}/oauth2/authorize?response_type=code&client_id={{clientId}}&scope=openid%20profile&redirect_uri=http://127.0.0.1:8081/login/oauth2/code/identityforge&state=missing-pkce-test
